{
  "slug": "consensus",
  "name": "Consensus",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Break through difficult problems by gathering diverse AI perspectives in parallel. Consensus queries multiple AI providers concurrently — GPT-5.2, Gemini 3.1 Pro, and DeepSeek V3.2 by default — then synthesizes their responses to surface agreements, unique insights, and actionable takeaways. Choose from any model available on OpenRouter, or route providers directly through their native APIs (OpenAI, Gemini). Add, remove, and configure providers interactively with natural language.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `ask` (When the user wants to cross-check ideas across multiple AI providers — look for phrases like \"consensus\", \"multiple…)\n- **Commands** (1): `config` (Manage provider configuration — check status, update models, add/remove/configure providers)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install consensus@claude-community` from `mark-kimura/consensus-plugin`.",
